      "content": "i get that but my doctor is like super busy and it takes weeks to even get a callback. it's just a little lightheadedness, i don't think it's a big deal. if i just take two pills once to see if it fixes the dizzy feeling faster, what's the worst that could happen? i just want to get back to normal.",
